                "en 512 bits / 64 bytes (corpus/documentos/bip-0039.mediawiki, § From mnemonic "
                "to seed, «The length of the derived key is 512 bits (= 64 bytes)»). "
                "256 bits es la ENTROPÍA del mnemonic de 24 palabras, no el tamaño de la seed. "
                "El código cifra esos 64 bytes (WALLET_SEED_BYTES)."
            ),
            "refs": "",
        }

    # --- explicit buckets ---
    eip55 = {1, 14, 18, 19, 73, 74, 75, 155, 156, 157, 199, 203, 231, 232}
